  },
  {
    tier: 'Tier-3 and low-cutoff private MBA',
    year1: 'Rs 6-12 LPA average where structured placement exists at all',
    year5: 'Rs 10-18 LPA, and growth here is reported as largely flat without deliberate reskilling',
